{"id":"6dfd9399e27daada","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-approximation-ratio.md","title":"Approximation Ratio","display":"df-approximation-ratio — Approximation Ratio","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-df-approximation-ratio","aliases":["28-df-approximation-ratio","Approximation Ratio"],"display":"df-approximation-ratio — Approximation Ratio","depends_on":[],"source_reference":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, Definition 11.1 and Example 11.3","source_printed_pages":"238–240","source_pdf_pages":"264–266","source_statement_verified":true,"source_proof_reviewed":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-approximation-ratio"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-approximation-ratio</span><span>Approximation Ratio</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-approximation-ratio — Approximation Ratio"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Arora–Barak, Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach, Definition 11.1 and Example 11.3"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"238–240"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"264–266"},{"key":"source_statement_verified","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal I\">\\(\\mathcal I\\)</span> 为实例集；每个实例 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\">\\(I\\)</span> 的可行解集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F(I)\">\\(F(I)\\)</span> 有限非空，目标函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v_I:F(I)\\to\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}\">\\(v_I:F(I)\\to\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal S\">\\(\\mathcal S\\)</span> 为满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bigcup_{I\\in\\mathcal I}F(I)\\subseteq\\mathcal S\">\\(\\bigcup_{I\\in\\mathcal I}F(I)\\subseteq\\mathcal S\\)</span> 的候选解集；算法的输出函数为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A:\\mathcal I\\to\\mathcal S\">\\(A:\\mathcal I\\to\\mathcal S\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho\\in\\mathbb R_{\\ge1}\">\\(\\rho\\in\\mathbb R_{\\ge1}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\\in(0,1]\">\\(\\alpha\\in(0,1]\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>上标 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{book}\">\\(\\mathrm{book}\\)</span> 标识下式定义的原书质量比例约定。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{OPT}^{\\max}(I)\\coloneqq\\max_{s\\in F(I)}v_I(s),\\qquad\\operatorname{OPT}^{\\min}(I)\\coloneqq\\min_{s\\in F(I)}v_I(s).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{OPT}^{\\max}(I)\\coloneqq\\max_{s\\in F(I)}v_I(s),\\qquad\\operatorname{OPT}^{\\min}(I)\\coloneqq\\min_{s\\in F(I)}v_I(s).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Approx}^{\\max}_\\rho(A)\\leftrightarrow\\forall I\\in\\mathcal I\\ \\exists s\\in F(I)\\ [A(I)=s\\land v_I(s)\\ge\\operatorname{OPT}^{\\max}(I)/\\rho].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Approx}^{\\max}_\\rho(A)\\leftrightarrow\\forall I\\in\\mathcal I\\ \\exists s\\in F(I)\\ [A(I)=s\\land v_I(s)\\ge\\operatorname{OPT}^{\\max}(I)/\\rho].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Approx}^{\\min}_\\rho(A)\\leftrightarrow\\forall I\\in\\mathcal I\\ \\exists s\\in F(I)\\ [A(I)=s\\land v_I(s)\\le\\rho\\operatorname{OPT}^{\\min}(I)].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Approx}^{\\min}_\\rho(A)\\leftrightarrow\\forall I\\in\\mathcal I\\ \\exists s\\in F(I)\\ [A(I)=s\\land v_I(s)\\le\\rho\\operatorname{OPT}^{\\min}(I)].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Approx}^{\\max,\\mathrm{book}}_\\alpha(A)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{Approx}^{\\max}_{1/\\alpha}(A),\\qquad \\operatorname{Approx}^{\\min,\\mathrm{book}}_\\alpha(A)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{Approx}^{\\min}_{1/\\alpha}(A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Approx}^{\\max,\\mathrm{book}}_\\alpha(A)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{Approx}^{\\max}_{1/\\alpha}(A),\\qquad \\operatorname{Approx}^{\\min,\\mathrm{book}}_\\alpha(A)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{Approx}^{\\min}_{1/\\alpha}(A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>显式要求输出可行解，避免只报出虚假的优目标值。书使用不超过一的质量比例 alpha；本节点的 rho 是不少于一的因子，二者互为倒数。非负目标值假设在前两节内；OPT=0 时仍使用乘法形式的比较，不出现除以OPT。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>来源：Definition 11.1 and Example 11.3，印刷页 238–240；PDF 页 264–266。已比对相应定义或陈述；形式编码与边界条件在本节点内展开。 本次未完整复核原书证明。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal I","display":false},{"tex":"I","display":false},{"tex":"F(I)","display":false},{"tex":"v_I:F(I)\\to\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal S","display":false},{"tex":"\\bigcup_{I\\in\\mathcal I}F(I)\\subseteq\\mathcal S","display":false},{"tex":"A:\\mathcal I\\to\\mathcal S","display":false},{"tex":"\\rho\\in\\mathbb R_{\\ge1}","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha\\in(0,1]","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{book}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{OPT}^{\\max}(I)\\coloneqq\\max_{s\\in F(I)}v_I(s),\\qquad\\operatorname{OPT}^{\\min}(I)\\coloneqq\\min_{s\\in F(I)}v_I(s).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Approx}^{\\max}_\\rho(A)\\leftrightarrow\\forall I\\in\\mathcal I\\ \\exists s\\in F(I)\\ [A(I)=s\\land v_I(s)\\ge\\operatorname{OPT}^{\\max}(I)/\\rho].","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Approx}^{\\min}_\\rho(A)\\leftrightarrow\\forall I\\in\\mathcal I\\ \\exists s\\in F(I)\\ [A(I)=s\\land v_I(s)\\le\\rho\\operatorname{OPT}^{\\min}(I)].","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Approx}^{\\max,\\mathrm{book}}_\\alpha(A)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{Approx}^{\\max}_{1/\\alpha}(A),\\qquad \\operatorname{Approx}^{\\min,\\mathrm{book}}_\\alpha(A)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{Approx}^{\\min}_{1/\\alpha}(A).","display":true}],"bytes":2174,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-143","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"近似与约束：[[28-df-approximation-ratio]]、[[28-df-label-cover]]。"}],"outgoing":[]}